WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:10.403
Open this demo’s record to check whether the job completed and how long it
took.

00:00:11.458 --> 00:00:20.746
The stage list shows whether each task has finished or is still in
progress.

00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:31.980
The output section lists the results saved by this run, such as its
generated video.

00:00:33.208 --> 00:00:42.508
The timeline shows when each stage was running, giving you a starting
point for investigating wait times.

00:00:43.583 --> 00:00:53.162
The comparison page places the two demo records side by side to show
differences in settings and elapsed time.

00:00:54.250 --> 00:01:04.362
Because the input conditions differ, the timing difference alone does not
prove that a setting improved speed.
